				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "UgpWNjeGTrqTy/sSvdaeiQ=="
				},
				"string" : "Create a Mondrian view with a force-based layout of a three-level graph of an author, its papers, and their co-authors. Represent each author as a light blue square with size proportional to the number of authored papers, and with authors initials (given name and surname) as the (centred) label. Hovering over the author box should show the full author name. Represent papers as light pink circles with their size proportional to the number of authors. Hovering over a paper will show its title. Clicking on a node will navigate to the paper or author."
			},
